      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "# Issue:\n\nWhen setting your height and then joining or switching the world, you will end up back at your original height. You need to do something to reinitialize the Avatar for it to switch back to the height you have set. (e.g. turning OSC off/on)\n\n  \n\n  **Repro Steps:**\n\n - Join a World with Avatar Scaling  \n\n - Change your Avatar Height via the Action Menu  \n\n - Rejoin the Instance or go to a different World with Avatar Scaling enabled  \n\n \n\n If you do this you will notice that your height is back at your Avatars default height. To fix this you need to reinitialize the Avatar. (e.g. turning OSC off/on)  \n\n# Expected Behavior:\n\nWhen re joining a World or switching to a different World / Instance your Avatar Height should be remembered and applied instantly.\n\n# Attachments:  \n\nHere is a video showcasing the issue:\n\nhttps://files.catbox.moe/4su97b.mp4",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
